{"reviews":[{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-0","r":5.0,"t":"Does the job","x":"Works as advertised. Seems hard to find this stuff in a gallon size like this, and with free shipping? I'm pleased. As a taxidermist, I use it to whiten deer skulls; submerge the cleaned skull in peroxide, leave overnight, and by the next day the bone is bright white. The peroxide foams up gradually as it works. One of these days I will remember to wear gloves when using it... always turns the pads of my fingers white (only temporarily, of course). That's when I know it's working!","h":67,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-1","r":1.0,"t":"This product is a complete ripoff.","x":"Real food grade H2o2 requires special shipping at a very high cost, but I thought I'd give this stuff a try in my hot tub.  If it was 35% food grade, I'd use 2 or 3 cups with excellent results.  I used the entire gallon of this useless product minutes after opening the package with virtually no results in my hot tub.  DO NOT WASTE YOUR TIME OR MONEY ON THIS STUFF.","h":32,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-2","r":1.0,"t":"STOP TAPING THE CAPS DOWN!","x":"Like many others this product came leaking everywhere! Please do not tape the caps DOWN! They are press and turn caps, they unseal when pressed......so why would you tape them in an unsealed position...... It did work great for whitening a seal spine, soaked for 3 days then boiled in the same 40 volume.  This is a huge safety issue for customers and the shipping companies!","h":23,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-3","r":5.0,"t":"Essential","x":"I like to wash produce in a dilute mix, as well as pour some into the water for my humidifiers. This helps disinfect the internal parts of the humidifier which is not otherwise cleanable. It can make a difference in breathing fungus that may have grown there.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great cleaning!","x":"I have a wet/dry vacuums and tile floors. I use this in my machine and it whitens the grout beautifully! Also, if you have old dishes that have crackled and stained, pour into the dish, and watch the magic! Some may need soaking twice, but it works!!!! Cleans cutting boards and counters! If put in small spray bottle, spray all surfaces in bathroom or kitchen, don\u2019t wipe off, let it air dry! After cleaning bird cages, I sometimes spray them and let air dry!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-5","r":5.0,"t":"Whitens a deer skull remarkably","x":"I bought this product to whiten deer skulls after watching Youtube videos.  I thought i was purchasing a different product, turns out this is a knock off of what i thought i was purchasing.  However, it did an amazing job.  My deer skull had the skin on longer than it should have been and was stained a little yellow, but this product did amazing on it.  I brushed the skull multiple times and poured about a cup of it in hot water (i was using  an  old pipe as a pot made of sch 40 stainless pipe s","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-6","r":2.0,"t":"It's not for cleaning skulls","x":"If you are trying to use this product in the final step of maceration, DON\"T!  I thought it was just heavier hydro perox, it's not. It's got other ingredients in it which will thin out the bones and wear off the tooth enamel like you-you soaked it in coca cola overnight. Get the cheap stuff, it'll work better for this phase of the process.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-7","r":5.0,"t":"Work great","x":"Used this for bleaching game skulls and works great.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-8","r":2.0,"t":"Sent back by UPS because of damage","x":"Leaked out a third of the product. Reordered and UPS returned it to the shippers because it was so damaged.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-9","r":3.0,"t":"Know what you are buying","x":"For all of the commentators  that are amateur chemists including the lady trying to treat her spa.... Just search for the sds for this product and it will tell you the H202 concentration. Jeeze.","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-10","r":5.0,"t":"40 percent peroxide","x":"Perfect for bleaching and cleaning my deer skull for an English mount.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-11","r":5.0,"t":"Works great for my usage","x":"Using to whiten deer antlers along with another product. Does the job","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-12","r":5.0,"t":"Game Changer!","x":"This is incredible!  I breed dogs.  Birth is messy.  (I'll spare you pictures. )  However,  after delivery,  I can dilute this product and treat my linens before and during a wash and it comes out white!  Game changer!  I also use this product, appropriately diluted,  to clean my household floors of doggy dirt.  PLUS, it does wonders on concrete and linoleum in the kennel.  I apply with a common farm sprayer.  Dirt just bubbles up from the tiny spaces where I can mop away with scrubbing.  It's a","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-13","r":4.0,"t":"Came in leaking","x":"Be careful when you open the box.. mime was wet from it leaking .. I got chemical burn","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-14","r":2.0,"t":"Leaked","x":"There was a leak and the shipping carton was damaged. I lost about a pint of the product. Also in wiping the bottle down it irritated my skin due to its strength. Be careful with this stuff","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-15","r":1.0,"t":"Sending less product than what is advertised and paid for.","x":"Don't buy from this company period. Delivered less product than what I paid for, and cap was not sealed. Avoid completely. Would be a zero star rating.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-16","r":2.0,"t":"Unsure if product is what it says it is.","x":"The bottle was not sealed. There was not any type of tamper proof seal. There is no way to tell if the product is truly what it says it is.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-17","r":5.0,"t":"Used to clean floor","x":"Used this to clean my tile floor grout. It worked great. Just have to let it sit for a few hours. Perfect around toilet.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-18","r":5.0,"t":"It works on hair great","x":"I bleach my sister-in-law wig with it and hot water and it turned from black to this light brown it 3 minutes","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-19","r":2.0,"t":"Not what I needed","x":"Bought this for a science experiment (elephant toothpaste) and it did not work at all. :(","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-20","r":5.0,"t":"Peroxide","x":"Good stuff, done a good job on my cow skull heads","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"Used to clean 100+ year old china.  Cleans GOOD","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-22","r":3.0,"t":"Good But problems with shipping.","x":"Bought a bottle of peroxide and it came in as expected but there was one problem. The bottle must have gotten shaken up during shipping and dampened the inside of the box and the plastic covering with the peroxide. When I went to take it out some got on my hand.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-23","r":3.0,"t":"Wrong product was delivered","x":"I've ordered liquid peroxide 3 times from these guys. First time was perfect, the last 2 times I was sent creme peroxide instead of liquid. I've been refunded but I really needed liquid. Just be cautious, you may receive creme instead of liquid.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B00TP1IZDE-24","r":3.0,"t":"Burnt hands!!! but great product","x":"It\u2019s a great product, but packaging was ripped up and chemical leaked all over the containers burning hands upon unwrapping. Once again great product just poor handling packaging and transport","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report the product works well for whitening and bleaching skulls and antlers.","cites":[1,6,8,11,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the product leaked during shipping, sometimes damaging the carton or causing skin irritation.","cites":[3,9,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise it for general cleaning uses like grout, dishes, floors, and linens.","cites":[4,5,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers warn it is not suitable for skull cleaning or is not the food-grade peroxide they expected.","cites":[2,7,10]}]},"qa":[]}